# AI Agent System Prompt & Workspace Rules

1. DO NOT auto-commit using git. Never run `git commit` unless explicitly instructed by the user in the prompt.
2. ALWAYS log all user development requests in `/app/REQUEST.md`.
3. ALWAYS store Implementation Plans and Walkthroughs in `/app/docs/history/YYYYMMDD_<feature_name>/` and link them in `REQUEST.md`.
4. ALWAYS keep `/app/requirements.txt` updated when installing new Python packages.
